00:50:06,360 --> 00:50:10,160
哦 不 没关系 我...我跟我妈吃
Oh, no, that's no problem, I'm...I have dinner plans with my mom.

776
00:50:10,550 --> 00:50:11,660
不是的
That's not true.

777
00:50:11,690 --> 00:50:13,480
我怕被拒
I'm sorry, I just wanted to close myself off

778
00:50:13,500 --> 00:50:15,950
才装作有事的
from the possibility of being rejected.

779
00:50:17,370 --> 00:50:18,580
没事
That's no problem.

780
00:50:20,050 --> 00:50:21,650
- 我去拿助燃油 - 好
- I'll get the lighter fluid. - Okay.

781
00:50:21,670 --> 00:50:23,230
屋里暖和 进来坐坐？
Do you wanna come inside while I look?

782
00:50:23,250 --> 00:50:25,430
算了 想在这儿等 行吗？
Uh, no, sorry. Can I wait outside?

783
00:50:25,460 --> 00:50:28,970
行 没问题 我马上给你
Yeah. Don't worry about it. Um, I'll be back soon.

784
00:50:40,970 --> 00:50:42,390
这该够用
This should do the trick.

785
00:50:43,610 --> 00:50:44,770
太好了 谢谢
Great, thanks.

786
00:50:44,790 --> 00:50:49,460
倒在要烧的东西上 就行了吧？
And so do I just pour this on the thing I want to be on fire?

787
00:50:49,480 --> 00:50:52,210
烧什么 烧烤吗？
On the barbecue?

788
00:50:52,790 --> 00:50:53,800
对
Yes.

789
00:50:53,820 --> 00:50:57,460
呃 嗯 别倒太多
Uh, yeah, don't put too much of it on there.

790
00:50:58,410 --> 00:50:59,620
好
Okay.

791
00:50:59,880 --> 00:51:01,980
要 要我帮忙吗？
Do you... do you want my help?

792
00:51:02,000 --> 00:51:03,210
不用
No.

793
00:51:04,810 --> 00:51:06,140
谢谢你...
Thank you...

794
00:51:06,320 --> 00:51:07,190
是盖文
Gavin.

795
00:51:07,220 --> 00:51:11,250
对 盖文 真谢谢你 盖文
Gavin. Yes. Thank you, definitely, Gavin.

796
00:51:13,860 --> 00:51:15,570
你不是住那边吗？
Uh, don't you live over there?

797
00:51:15,590 --> 00:51:18,610
啥 哦 对 确实是 哈哈
Ha! Yup, I... yup, definitely. Oops.

798
00:51:28,400 --> 00:51:30,530
{\an1}（《乔凡尼的房间》）

799
00:51:28,400 --> 00:51:35,700
{\an9}【《乔凡尼的房间》：詹姆斯·鲍德温（美）所著小说 聚焦同性恋身份与孤独】

800
00:51:48,120 --> 00:51:50,000
从哪儿弄的？
Why do you have that?

801
00:51:50,390 --> 00:51:52,360
找邻居要的
I got it from the neighbor.

802
00:51:53,460 --> 00:51:54,840
干嘛要？
Why?

803
00:51:54,960 --> 00:51:58,490
肯定不是正常人会有的想法
It's definitely not, like, a good or normal train of thought.

804
00:51:59,050 --> 00:52:00,550
好
Okay.

805
00:52:01,020 --> 00:52:04,770
我本来想把德克尔办公室烧掉
I think I was gonna light Decker's office on fire.

806
00:52:08,990 --> 00:52:10,150
好
Okay...

807
00:52:12,240 --> 00:52:14,780
你真想这么做吗
Do you still wanna do it?

808
00:52:15,280 --> 00:52:16,640
没想好
I don't know.

809
00:52:21,090 --> 00:52:22,710
那我来做
I will do it.

810
00:52:23,780 --> 00:52:26,050
你真好
That's really nice.

811
00:52:27,960 --> 00:52:29,180
但不用
But no.

812
00:52:29,210 --> 00:52:32,820
认真说 要是你想烧他办公室
No, seriously. If you need someone to burn his office down,

813
00:52:32,840 --> 00:52:36,290
又不想自己去 我替你做
but you don't wanna do it yourself, I will do it.

814
00:52:36,320 --> 00:52:39,510
不 我甚至不想咒他死
No, I don't even want him to die.

815
00:52:39,620 --> 00:52:41,010
我想
I do.

816
00:52:42,680 --> 00:52:44,840
我不想他死
I don't want him to die.

817
00:52:46,180 --> 00:52:48,640
好吧 改主意了就告诉我
Well, if you change your mind...

818
00:52:48,680 --> 00:52:50,020
谢谢
Thanks.

819
00:52:52,710 --> 00:52:55,090
也许一起烧点小的
Maybe we could burn something smaller,

820
00:52:55,110 --> 00:52:58,450
他头发或他笔之类的
like his hair or his pens or something.

821
00:52:58,770 --> 00:53:00,370
我会考虑的
I'll think about that.

822
00:53:01,700 --> 00:53:02,830
好
Okay.

823
00:53:07,120 --> 00:53:10,130
哎 还得去做烤肠
I have to make hot dogs.

824
00:53:10,160 --> 00:53:11,360
为嘛？
Oh, why?

825
00:53:11,390 --> 00:53:15,870
我跟邻居编了大谎 不烤心里过不去
I told the neighbor, it's like this whole big lie. I'm stuck in a lie.

826
00:53:15,890 --> 00:53:17,940
好 我来做
Okay. I will do it.

827
00:53:17,970 --> 00:53:19,460
对不起
I'm sorry.

828
00:53:19,490 --> 00:53:22,930
没事 我本想砍个人 相比这小菜一碟
No, it's fine. I was gonna, like, kill a man, so this is much easier.

829
00:53:22,960 --> 00:53:26,070
家里有烤肠吗？
Do we have hot dogs?

830
00:53:27,240 --> 00:53:29,050
不知道
I don't know.

831
00:54:43,640 --> 00:54:44,680
嗨
Hi.

832
00:54:51,190 --> 00:54:53,870
好 我要去买咖啡
Okay. I'm going to get coffee.

833
00:54:57,700 --> 00:54:59,830
我能抱你吗？
Do you want me to pick you up?

834
00:55:08,970 --> 00:55:11,180
哦 天呐
Well, fuck.

835
00:55:11,570 --> 00:55:14,870
太美好了
This is really nice.

836
00:55:16,430 --> 00:55:17,910
我想...
I guess um...

837
00:55:18,730 --> 00:55:21,080
对 我爱你
Yup. I love you.

838
00:55:25,720 --> 00:55:28,260
愿意陪我买咖啡吗？
You wanna come get coffee?

839
00:55:28,980 --> 00:55:30,910
三文鱼罐头？
Salmon.

840
00:55:31,480 --> 00:55:35,520
好吧 挺挑食的 有品位
All right, you're picky, an excellent quality.

841
00:55:35,570 --> 00:55:36,860
金枪鱼的？
Tuna.

842
00:55:38,980 --> 00:55:41,320
可能隔着罐头闻不出来
Maybe you're just smelling the can.

843
00:55:41,340 --> 00:55:43,320
里面是金枪鱼
There's tuna inside.

844
00:55:43,790 --> 00:55:46,070
好 各买一罐
All right, one of each.

845
00:56:02,470 --> 00:56:03,590
嗨
Hey.

846
00:56:04,600 --> 00:56:06,010
就这些吗？
Is this all for you today?

847
00:56:06,040 --> 00:56:07,740
是的 麻烦了
Yes, thank you.

848
00:56:12,530 --> 00:56:15,240
你带猫进来了吗？
Did you bring a cat into the grocery store?

849
00:56:16,210 --> 00:56:17,870
没有啦
No.

850
00:56:19,450 --> 00:56:20,590
就有
Yes, you did.

851
00:56:20,610 --> 00:56:22,570
信号不好 说啥？
What did you say?

852
00:56:22,600 --> 00:56:24,070
你骗人
You're lying.

853
00:56:24,360 --> 00:56:25,960
不 才没呢
No, I'm not.

854
00:56:32,830 --> 00:56:36,300
您的猫粮 谢谢惠顾
Here's your cat food.

855
00:56:39,170 --> 00:56:40,550
咖啡没了
We ran out of coffee.

856
00:56:40,580 --> 00:56:42,160
我买了
I got some.

857
00:56:44,170 --> 00:56:45,810
我捡了只猫
I got a cat.

858
00:56:50,570 --> 00:56:52,190
挺你啦
Whatever you need.

859
00:59:16,030 --> 00:59:22,410
{\an8}善问 恶问与自问的时光

860
00:59:19,590 --> 00:59:25,430
谢谢大家来履行陪审员传召
Thank you for being here and completing your summons.

861
00:59:25,540 --> 00:59:30,460
还没填的 不清楚流程的
For those of you who haven't done this and don't know what to expect,

862
00:59:31,290 --> 00:59:35,340
请上前来领问卷表
please come up and get a questionnaire.

863
00:59:36,260 --> 00:59:40,720
填好交回来
Fill it out and return it to us completed.

864
00:59:44,520 --> 00:59:49,100
要用笔的话 请来拿
We have little pencils if you need a little pencil.

865
00:59:49,316 --> 00:59:52,863
{\an2}（陪审员资格问卷表 姓名：安尼丝·沃德 年龄：28岁）

