Oh, really, does that happen?

1349
01:30:13,530 --> 01:30:15,500
因为我的脸吗？ 呵呵
Is it my face?

1350
01:30:18,890 --> 01:30:20,680
因为我的脸吗？
Hello, is it my face?

1351
01:30:43,040 --> 01:30:44,230
灯塔游！
Lighthouse day!

1352
01:30:44,250 --> 01:30:45,340
灯塔游
Lighthouse day.

1353
01:30:45,370 --> 01:30:48,090
弗兰 弗兰 灯塔游！
Fran. Fran. Lighthouse day!

1354
01:30:48,120 --> 01:30:49,370
灯塔游
Lighthouse day.

1355
01:30:49,500 --> 01:30:51,610
简妮 简妮 灯塔游！
Janie, Janie. Lighthouse day!

1356
01:30:51,630 --> 01:30:54,070
她昨晚没怎么睡 你懂的
She actually didn't sleep super well, so.

1357
01:30:54,090 --> 01:30:54,490
哦
Oh.

1358
01:30:54,510 --> 01:30:57,320
是啊 我们真的 真的筋疲力尽
Yeah, we're really, really fucking tired.

1359
01:30:57,480 --> 01:31:00,650
她今天不太适合大活动
Yeah, I don't think she's gonna be in for, like, a big thing today.

1360
01:31:00,670 --> 01:31:01,830
说宝宝吗？
The baby?

1361
01:31:01,850 --> 01:31:04,890
她只是个小宝宝 应该没问题
Well, she's just a baby, she could do whatever.

1362
01:31:05,120 --> 01:31:06,620
其实不见得
I mean, not really.

1363
01:31:07,190 --> 01:31:09,310
你们俩去吧 我留下来
But you two go. I will stay here.

1364
01:31:09,340 --> 01:31:10,680
真的？行
Oh, really? Okay.

1365
01:31:10,730 --> 01:31:12,510
我真想让你也看看
I really wanted you to see it.

1366
01:31:12,530 --> 01:31:15,200
宝贝 会有机会的 放心
Babe, I will see it at some point. It's okay.

1367
01:31:15,990 --> 01:31:17,420
好吧
Okay.

1368
01:31:22,670 --> 01:31:23,830
别
No.

1369
01:31:24,490 --> 01:31:26,790
不 你俩都去
No, you two go.

1370
01:31:26,880 --> 01:31:29,690
不行 总得有人陪简
No, no, someone has to stay with Jane.

1371
01:31:30,170 --> 01:31:31,380
我来
I'll do it.

1372
01:31:33,440 --> 01:31:35,150
你确定？
Really?

1373
01:31:35,330 --> 01:31:37,830
哦 简比较难伺候
Oh, Jane is actually really particular.

1374
01:31:37,940 --> 01:31:39,530
交给我吧
I will do it.

1375
01:31:42,690 --> 01:31:45,060
天呐 安尼丝 太谢谢你了
Oh, my God. Agnes, thank you so much.

1376
01:31:45,090 --> 01:31:47,490
弗兰 我们自由了！自由了！
Fran, we're free! We're free.

1377
01:31:48,260 --> 01:31:49,510
灯塔很浪漫的
The lighthouse is very romantic.

1378
01:31:49,530 --> 01:31:51,420
就该你俩去
You two should be there alone together.

1379
01:31:51,440 --> 01:31:53,860
再造个宝宝什么的
Make another baby or whatever.

1380
01:31:53,880 --> 01:31:56,120
就二十分钟 很快的
Like, twenty minutes, that's it.

1381
01:31:56,140 --> 01:31:58,860
问一下 她会不会把我吃了？
One question. What if she kills me?

1382
01:31:58,880 --> 01:32:00,740
她不吃人
She's not gonna kill you.

1383
01:32:08,090 --> 01:32:09,130
嘿...
Hey...

1384
01:32:10,420 --> 01:32:12,430
别抱掉了
Don't drop her.

1385
01:32:13,250 --> 01:32:15,700
不会 我抱不掉的
No. I won't drop her.

1386
01:32:20,560 --> 01:32:21,680
好...
Okay...

1387
01:32:22,700 --> 01:32:23,950
好了
Okay.

1388
01:32:24,770 --> 01:32:25,770
好的
Okay.

1389
01:32:27,440 --> 01:32:28,570
谢谢
Thank you.

1390
01:32:29,940 --> 01:32:31,720
给你小兔兔
Here you go.

1391
01:32:32,690 --> 01:32:34,190
太谢谢了
Thank you.

1392
01:32:35,210 --> 01:32:36,860
- 给你 宝贝 - 谢谢
- Here you go, babe. - Thank you.

1393
01:32:36,910 --> 01:32:37,910
利迪？
Lydie?

1394
01:32:38,340 --> 01:32:39,510
嗯？
Yeah?

1395
01:32:40,240 --> 01:32:42,170
我该对她说点啥？
What do I say to her?

1396
01:32:42,190 --> 01:32:44,280
宝贝 什么都不用说
Babe, you don't have to say anything.

1397
01:32:44,500 --> 01:32:46,010
就二十分钟
Twenty minutes.

1398
01:33:18,160 --> 01:33:19,230
嗨
Hi.

1399
01:33:20,110 --> 01:33:21,390
我是安尼丝
I'm Agnes.

1400
01:33:24,290 --> 01:33:29,240
真神奇 最终你会长成个独立的人
Pretty weird you're gonna be a person someday.

1401
01:33:29,260 --> 01:33:31,610
别介意 你现在真有点吓人
No offense, but you look insane right now.

1402
01:33:31,630 --> 01:33:34,450
光溜溜 头发很少
Skin and just a small amount of hair.

1403
01:33:35,740 --> 01:33:37,150
别担心
Don't worry.

1404
01:33:38,140 --> 01:33:39,970
很快会变样的
It won't be like that in a little.

1405
01:33:46,030 --> 01:33:48,860
能抱抱你吗？
Is this okay or...

1406
01:34:02,550 --> 01:34:03,760
行
All right.

1407
01:34:04,910 --> 01:34:06,470
不抱了
I'll put you down.

1408
01:34:06,500 --> 01:34:08,620
想要啊 那就再抱起来
Oh. I'll pick you back up.

1409
01:34:08,640 --> 01:34:10,150
抱了 抱了 抱了
Okay, okay, okay.

1410
01:34:35,280 --> 01:34:36,890
你长得真漂亮
You're so sweet looking.

1411
01:34:52,240 --> 01:34:56,940
等你长大后 不管什么想法...
When you grow up, you can tell me whatever.

1412
01:34:57,840 --> 01:35:02,730
都可以告诉我 哪怕是个坏念头
Like, if you have a thought and you're like, that's a bad thought,

1413
01:35:03,890 --> 01:35:08,310
我很可能也有过 而且更坏
I probably had that same thought but, like, ten times worse.

1414
01:35:10,230 --> 01:35:12,610
所以你尽管说
So you can just tell me.

1415
01:35:13,260 --> 01:35:16,340
我不会大惊小怪的
I'll never be scared by that.

1416
01:35:20,740 --> 01:35:24,120
要是有人对你做了桩噩事...
If someone does something bad to you...

1417
01:35:24,220 --> 01:35:27,580
有人借此闲言碎语 冷嘲热讽...
If someone says something scary...

1418
01:35:29,180 --> 01:35:34,770
让你想用铅笔 刀之类的东西自尽
If you wanna kill yourself with like a pencil or a knife or whatever,

1419
01:35:36,500 --> 01:35:38,900
都可以跟我说
you can just tell me.

1420
01:35:41,760 --> 01:35:46,330
我永远不会评头论足 大惊小怪
I'll never tell you you're scaring me.

1421
01:35:46,370 --> 01:35:49,930
我只会说 嗯 我知道...
I'll just say, yeah. I know.

1422
01:35:50,720 --> 01:35:53,850
事情有时就这样
It's just like that sometimes.

1423
01:35:53,880 --> 01:35:54,970
嗯
Yeah.

1424
01:35:58,650 --> 01:35:59,830
对不起
I'm sorry

1425
01:36:00,860 --> 01:36:03,600
坏事可能会找上你
that bad things are gonna happen to you.

1426
01:36:05,820 --> 01:36:07,990
希望不会
I hope they don't.

1427
01:36:08,300 --> 01:36:11,780
要是我能阻止 一定要跟我说
If I can ever stop something from being bad, let me know.

1428
01:36:14,440 --> 01:36:17,930
坏事不会给你打招呼
But sometimes bad stuff just happens.

1429
01:36:20,490 --> 01:36:23,040
所以我有点心疼你
That's why I feel bad for you,

1430
01:36:23,070 --> 01:36:24,320
某种程度上
in a way.

1431
01:36:26,090 --> 01:36:32,360
你活着却还体会不到
That you're alive and you don't know that yet.

1432
01:36:38,820 --> 01:36:42,180
但我还是能静心聆听的
But I can still listen

1433
01:36:42,200 --> 01:36:44,390
不会大惊小怪
and not be scared.

1434
01:36:48,670 --> 01:36:50,290
这很好
So that's good.

1435
01:36:52,040 --> 01:36:55,110
至少是点儿安慰
Or that's something, at least.

